      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This document outlines the end-to-end technical execution flow, data flow, and runtime mechanics of the Virtual CFO Agentic AI assistant. It\nexplains how user queries are routed, how Gemini dynamically calls accounting APIs, and catalog-level details of all 16 integration tools.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This document outlines the end-to-end technical execution flow, data flow, and runtime mechanics of the Virtual CFO Agentic AI assistant. It explains how user queries are routed, how Gemini dynamically calls accounting APIs, and catalog-level details of all 16 integration tools.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
